<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise des Eaux 6-mth attrib net up.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise des Eaux 6-mth attrib net up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     635  vs	     506</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 1,703  vs	   1,482</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     3,181  vs	   3,219</p>
<p>    Turnover				    44,370  vs	  48,346</p>
<p>NOTE - Lyonnaise des Eaux said pre-tax pre-exceptional profit growth of 15 percent and net attributable profit growth of 25 percent was due to the strong performance of its communications and environmental services activities.</p>
<p>It said the board confirmed at a meeting on Wednesday the group's objectives to focus on activities with regular operating profitability and its international expansion.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
